Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)我押上了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}押在游马那份相信他人的力量上。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你们这些家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和快斗在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想知道的话就先打倒我们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就用我的新银河眼时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来粉碎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和快斗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到竟要与银河眼使用者战斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是奇妙的因缘。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从零开始教快斗决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并锻炼他的人是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！作为对手正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把你们俩一起收拾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两个人想同时对付我们两个？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})真是被小看得太厉害了呢，兄长大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你们两个人一起上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对Neo·Takion也完全不是对手这件事……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你们好好领教一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，米哈艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是，兄长大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我带着纳修回巴利安？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)没错。现在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能让你跟纳修和游马打起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，阿里特你继续去找游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了，贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）为什么我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非得听从
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙的命令啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:01:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀哎呀，是谁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你们从沉睡中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唤醒的，你们不会忘了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？你在说什么啊，你这混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，看来这家伙得再{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给他一次力量才行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.71,0:02:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用千尊之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊之力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）这、这家伙是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾将赐予你们更强大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋，贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊之力竟然在你手上！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你们就是我的傀儡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我好好干活啊 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)游马为了拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去了异次元世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(收银员)他让我转告二位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不用担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个异次元 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)奶奶！ 可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)你不是听他们俩说了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马说不用担心他这么说了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 他去了异世界啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么拯救世界胡来也该有个限度……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一定会回来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对 绝对会平安回来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 一定会的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)嗯相信游马 等着他。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们这样就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 为了游马不管什么时候回来都行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭就多做一些备着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《明里：游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐相信你哦》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)你是在想V和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)是啊 居然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了那种像吵架分手一样的结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想替{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}报仇——
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们两个人的心情 我特别能理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 被愤怒驱使的决斗什么也孕育不出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是想传达这个啊 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你之所以会那样想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们也有他们自己的想法吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信那是正确的选择了自己前进的道路。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我们也只能自己思考{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信自己认为正确的道路走下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直以来 我们不都是这样走过来的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《V {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两人共用生命值吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是先攻由我们来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我先来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将手牌中的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深空巡洋舰·九号的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:07:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过将手牌中的机械族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将另一张机械族。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深空巡洋舰·九号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，深空巡洋舰·九号。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再以魔法卡 死者苏生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的深空巡洋舰·九号\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级9的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深空巡洋舰·九号 2只进行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠光网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.9。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天盖星 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊，No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)看来那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经开始决斗了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法召唤破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家下个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法通过魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们七皇的决斗数据{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已通过我弟弟托马斯进行了分析。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的关键卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 你以为这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能封住我召唤新·时空龙吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥大人！
