Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡超量召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的1只 No.怪兽装备{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并按其攻击力数值提升攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 墓地中存在着戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要装备这张卡阿特兰塔尔的攻击力就会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气提升到5400！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 时空之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方超量召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以装备到银河眼上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)然后 这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的怪兽超量效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:16:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 阿特兰塔尔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赢不了我的时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这种程度还在预测范围内。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米哈艾尔！用我盖下的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用您说。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 银白色混沌之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级６的阿特兰塔尔 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用１只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:17:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.6！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打破有限的时空{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今 将那份存在刻于天地之间！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌阿特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙也用了等级提升魔法……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是正戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！混沌阿特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌惩罚！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动银河眼残光龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……你无论如何都想把银河眼时空龙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就知道你会来这一手。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）因为塔奇恩·弗莱亚·翼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以能够发动混沌亚特兰提尔的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将进行过战斗的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成装备卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！混沌亚特兰提尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把塔奇恩·龙夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奇恩·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后每装备1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌亚特兰提尔的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就提升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奇恩·龙被夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是为了装备
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泷音·龙而布下的局。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乍看之下，凭借泷音·闪翼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎逃过了破坏，但{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反过来却被剥得一干二净，就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那群家伙就是瞄准了这一瞬间。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……竟敢耍这种小聪明。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我尝到如此屈辱，还是头一回。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承蒙夸奖，荣幸之至。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，别以为这样就能封住我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障混沌抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级魔法·第七之壹！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，随时都能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以召唤新空间· tachy on·龙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的真正目的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第七·一即使从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者从额外卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出超量·No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其混沌化并升阶的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在 tachy on·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既不在墓地也不在额外卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在混沌化之前 不将其破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是作为装备怪兽夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.49,0:21:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第七·一的那一点点空隙被你们抓住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始你们的目标就只有一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻止新空间·银河眼· tachy on·龙的召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是你们的目的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀呀呀… 米扎酱～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点不够帅哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)这样一来 你就等同于被折断了翅膀。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:21:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.61,0:23:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.90,0:24:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
